title Too far forward
intro Blue is passing the ball up to a striker.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-CB at 78, 40
  player R-RB at 74, 20
  player R-LB at 74, 56
  player B-LF at 88, 30
  player B-CM at 55, 34
  ball with B-CM

step
  caption Watch where Blue is when the ball is played.
  draw line 78, 0 to 78, 68

step
  caption Blue kicks it forward. Their striker is already past the last Red defender.
  ball to 86, 30
  arrow from B-CM to ball
  draw line 78, 0 to 78, 68
  duration 1300

question
  prompt Is Blue offside?
  answer Yes
  wrong No
  wrong Only if they score
  wrong Only in the box
  correct Offside.
  why When the ball was kicked, Blue was closer to Red's goal than the last defender. You need two Red players, usually the goalie and one defender, between you and their goal.

question
  prompt What happens now?
  answer Red gets a free kick
  wrong Blue plays on
  wrong Blue gets a corner
  wrong Red gets a penalty
  correct Red gets a free kick.
  why Play stops and Red restarts with a free kick from where the Blue striker was standing.
